# Built binaries are ~96 MB each. They are attached to GitHub Releases rather
# than committed: git keeps every version forever, so committing them would add
# ~96 MB to the repo on every rebuild and would eventually break pushes
# (GitHub hard-rejects files over 100 MB).
# `npm run dist` still drops a copy here for local use.
